    "chunk_text": "AN order to provide for the services during the year 2019, to authorize the raising of loans within the Province of Sabaragamuwafor the purpose of such service, to make financial provisions in respect of certain activities of the Sabaragamuwa ProvincialCouncil during that more months, to enable the payment, by way of advances out of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Councilfund or any other fund or monies of, or at the disposal of, the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council Fund, and to make Provisionfor matters connected with or incidental to the aforesaid matter.\n\nBE it enacted by me, the Governor of the Sabaragamuwa Province of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows.\n\n2. (1).Without prejudice to any other law authorizing any expenditure of the Sabaragamuwa ProvincialCouncil which estimate will be Rupees Thirty One Billion and One Hundred Million(Rs. 31,100,000,000) for the Service of the period beginning on 01st January 2019 and ending on31st December. 2019 in this order referred to as the \u2018\u2018financial year 2019\u2019\u2019 shall be met.\n\n(a) For payments which are hereby authorized to be made out of the Sabaragamuwa ProvincialCouncil fund or monies of or advance at the disposal of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Counciland,\n\nGranting permis-sion\n\nAppropriation forthe financial year2019\n\n2AIV ^w& jeks fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'07'24PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.07.2019\n\n(b) For the Proceeds of loans which are hereby authorized to be raised, within the province ofSabaragamuwa for and on behalf of the Sabaragamuwa Provincial Council. The Sum of RupeesThirty One Billion and One Hundred Million (Rs. 31,100,000,000/-) here in before referred to maybe duly expended as specified in the first schedule to this order."
