    "chunk_text": "wxl 2133$60 - 2019 cQ,s ui 26 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'07'26\n\nNo. 2133/60 \u2013 FRIDAY, JULY 26, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 30605 - 42 (07/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS\n\nAMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDEMENT) ACT , No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nReference No.: 10/3/1/3/70.\n\nLand Ministry's Reference No.: 4/3/7/2012/HW/65.\n\nI, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following lands/servitudeswhich are required for extend and Developing of Matale-Illukkumbura - Pallegama Road.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nAllotments of land described in bellow in Plan No. Ma1670,Approved by Matale Senior Superintendents of Surveys,situated in Kaikawala, Pallegama village, Kaikawala, PallegamaGramaniladari Divisions in Sub Division of Matale Pallesiya\n\nPattuwa in the Rattota Divisional Secretariat Division, in MataleDistrict, in Central Province.\n\nLot No. 2Name of Land: Bandarawatta; Description of Land: OpenWaste land; Claimant: Rattota Pradeshiya Sabha; Extent: 0.0035Hectare.\n\nLot No. 6Name of Land: Pingollewatta; Description of Land: OpenWaste land; Claimant: Mr. R. M. Bandara, Matale Road,Rattota; Extent: 0.0053 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 9Name of Land: Bandarawatta; Description of Land: OpenWaste land; Claimant: Department of Small Industry; Extent:0.0057 Hectare.\n\nLot No. 12Name of Land: Bandarawatta; Description of Land: OpenWaste land; Claimant: Samurdhi Bank - Karuwawa; Extent:0.0017 Hectare."
