    "chunk_size_bytes": 2109,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2134/41 - 2019 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 31 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.07.31\n\nNo. 2134/41 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JULY 31, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice Under Section 7\n\nMy No.: KWDS/LND/01/ACQ/111/2017. Land Ministry No. : 4-3/15/1/2017/VE/411.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the land Acquisition Act as Land Acquisition (Amended) act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire following land / servitude which is required for a public purpose:\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotment of known as Puhulpelpola/Kiripussayahena and shown as lot 1401 sheet number 08 and Supplement number 08 (01 block) of land in total extend of about 2.5015 hectares F.V.P. 946 situated Weddagala Village and Weddagala West Grama Niladhari Division in Meda Pattu of Kukulu Korale in Kalawana Divisional Secretariat Division of Ratnapura District Sabaragamuwa Province.\n\n1. Lot No. 1401 In F. V. P. 649 Name of the land: Puhulpalpola; Name and Address of the Claimant: Mrs. D. K. D. Tewarapperuma, Asiri Mawatha, Battaramulla ; Extent: 2.5015 Hectares.\n\nFor Public purpose : The Acquisition of the Land for supplying optional lands for displaced families.\n\nAll persons interested in this land should be appear personally on 25th day of October, 2019 at 10.00 a.m., Kalawana Divisional Secretariat and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (with 2 duplicates) on or before the 15th day of October 2019, and nature of interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nSANJEEWANI KANDAMBI, Divisional Secretary, Kalawana.\n\nAt Divisional Secretariat of Kalawana, 24th July, 2019.\n\n08 - 584\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)"
  },
