    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'02'07PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 07.02.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n2134$48 \u2013 2019 wf.daia;= 01 jeks n%yiam;skaod \u2013 2019'08'01No. 2134/48 \u2013 THURSDAY, AUGUST 01, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 30651 \u2013 13 (08/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary\n\nReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the\n\nLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a\n\npublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotments of Land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GA/\n\nGFG/2016/313 and dated 14.09.2016 situated in the Village of Dadalla\n\nin the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kadawathsathara in Galle\n\nDistrict in Southern Province and bounded by the lands with following\n\nnames and extent:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Kanaththa or Kanaththa Waththa and Deniya\n\nKanaththa \u2013 Extent: About 0.2962 Hectare\n\nNorth: Generalge Waththa claimed by Ginthota Depot, Ceylon\n\nTransport Board; East: Lot B and Atambagaha Waththa; South: Lot\n\nB; West: Lot B and Generalge Waththa claimed by Ginthota Depot,\n\nCeylon Transport Board."
