    "chunk_text": "(b) a duly signed photograph of the retail subscriber with his or her signature where the photograph of theretail subscriber in the National Identity Card or Driving License or Passport is not clear ;\n\n3.(a) the address in the National Identity Card shall be considered as the permanent address.\n\n4. National Identity Card number of the retail subscriber shall be entered in the operator\u2019s database or networkprior to activation of the SIM.\n\n5. Scanned copies of the documents listed in items 1, 2 and 3 shall be uploaded on the operator\u2019s database ornetwork within one month of the SIM Card activation as and when required by an authorized officer.\n\n6. Update the subscriber details referred to in paragraph 1, 2 and 3 in accordance with paragraph 5 from time totime and submit such details to an authorized officer when requests for such information.\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'02PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 02.08.20193A\n\n7. Every operator is required to provide access to the database or network as and when required by TRCSL, to obtaininformation and data of a subscriber.\n\n8. Every operator is required to disconnect the telephone connection if the instructions set out in paragraph 5, arenot followed within one month from the date of SIM Card activation.\n\n(Regulation 2)\n\nSCHEDULE II\n\nREGISTRATION OF CORPORATE SUBSCRIBERS\n\nEvery operator shall comply with the following regulatory measures when registering corporate subscriber SIM Cards.\n\n1. Obtain an application form or agreement seeking a corporate subscriber SIM Card to a new telephone corporateaccount, under a corporate package duly signed by an authorized officer of the corporate subscriber.\n\n2. The application referred to in paragraph 1 shall accompany the following :-\n\n(a) a true copy of the certificate of Business Registration ;"
