    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 05.08.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2135$13 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 05 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'08'05No. 2135/13 - MONDAY, AUGUST 05, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A G 30670\u2014 22 (08/2019)\n\nADMINISTRATIVE DISTRICTS ACT, No. 22 OF 1955\n\nNotice of inclusion of Colombo Port City Land as a part of Colombo Administrative District under theSection 3 of Administrative Districts Act, No. 22 of 1955\n\nI, Wajira Abeywardena, the Minister of Internal & Home Affairs and Provincial Councils and Local Government, dohereby give notice to the General Public of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka that the area of authority andthe limits of the Administrative District of Colombo specified in the First Schedule to the Administrative District Act,No. 22 of 1955 shall be altered by inclusion of the reclaimed area of land known as \u2018Port City Colombo\u2019 described in theSchedule hereto, within the area of authority and the limits of the Administrative District of Colombo based on theresolution passed in the Parliament on 23rd of July 2019.\n\nThis reclaimed area of land shall be annexed to Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Colombo in the AdministrativeDistrict of Colombo.\n\nWAJIRA ABEYWARDENA,Minister of Internal & Home Affairs andProvincial Councils and Local Government.02nd of August, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE"
