    "chunk_text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'08'05PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nwxl 2135$15 \u2013 2019 wf.daia;= 05 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'08'05No. 2135/15 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 05, 2019\n\nMy No.: IR/22/05/2013.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nRevocation of Order under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS by order made under Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (RevisedEdition 1956) as amended by Acts, No. 14 and 62 of 1957, 14 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 read with Industrial Disputes(Special Provisions)Act, No. 37 of 1968 dated 29.12.2016 and published in the Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka Extra-OrdinaryNo. 2000/47 dated 04.01.2017 the Industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour dated02.12.2016.\n\nMr. M. A. Ranasinghe, Padiwatte, Kundasale, Nattarampotha of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lankan Airlines Limited, Airline Centre, Bandaranaike International Airport, Katunayaka. of the other part\n\nwas referred to Mr. P. Danansooriya for settlement by arbitration.\n\nAND whereas it is now deemed expedient that the said Order be revoked, I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade UnionRelations do hereby revoke the said Order and further make Order that no proceedings be taken upon the said Order dated 29.12.2016.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,24th July, 2019.\n\n08 - 728/1\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G30672 \u2013 21 (2019/08)"
