    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'02PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 02.08.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2135$19 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 05 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'08'05No. 2135/19 - MONDAY, AUGUST 05, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERALGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A PG 4607\u2014 517 (08/2019)\n\nL.D.B. 6/2017\n\nTHE CIVIL AVIATION ACT, No. 14 OF 2010\n\nOrder under Section 6\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 6 of the Civil Aviation Act, No. 14 of 2010, I, Arjuna Ranatunga, Ministerof Transport and Civil Aviation, in consultation with the Civil Aviation Authority, do by this Order amend the Schedule IIof the Order made by the Minister of Civil Aviation and published in Gazette Extrarodinary No. 1797/27 of February 15,2013 as amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1973/77 of July 01, 2016 by repealing paragraph 1thereof and the substitution therefor of the following :-\n\n\u201c1. The Development, operation and maintenance of-\n\n(i) Bandaranaike International Airport, Colombo in the Western Province ;\n\n(ii) Mattala Rajapaksa International Airport in the Southern Province ;\n\n(iii) Colombo Airport, Ratmalana in the Western Province ;\n\n(iv) Batticaloa Airport in the Eastern Province ; and\n\n(v) Palaly Airport in the Northern Province.\u201d.\n\nARJUNA RANATUNGA,Minister of Transport and Civil Aviation.Battaramulla,05th August, 2019.\n\n08- 745\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
