    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'08'05PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 05.08.2019\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2135$20 \u2013 2019 wf.daia;= 05 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'08'05No. 2135/20 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 05, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI , Gayantha Karunatilleke , Minister of Lands and Parliamentary\n\nReforms, do hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the\n\nLand Acquisition Act, that the Land described below is needed for a\n\npublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAn allotment of land situated in the village of Viharahena (F.V.P.\n\n169) in the Minor Division of Morawak Korale in the Divisional\n\nSecretariat Division of Kotapola in the District of Matara of Southern\n\nProvince, depicted as Lot A in Surveyor Generals Tracing No. MR/\n\nKTP/2018/249 and dated 07.08.2018 and containing in extent about\n\n3.0766 Hectares and the boundaries of the land given below.\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Ensalwatta of Viharahena \u2013 Extent: 3.0766\n\nHectares\n\nNorth and East: Ensalwatta of Viharahena claimed by the Lands\n\nReforms Commission; South: Ensalwatta of Viharahena claimed by\n\nthe Lands Reforms Commission and the Road (RDA); West:\n\n1A \u2013 G30676\u2013 36 (2019/08)\n\nEnsalwatta of Viharahena claimed by the Lands Reforms\n\nCommission.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/4/2018/D/79.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\"Mihikatha Medura\",Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.\n\n11th July, 2019.\n\n08 - 746\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5"
