    "chunk_text": "1 AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'06PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 06.08.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2135$38 - 2019 wf.daia;= ui 06 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'08'06\n\nNo. 2135/38 - TUESDAY, AUGUST, 06, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A PG 4608 \u2014 17 (08/2019)\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPROVINCIAL COUNCIL NOTIFICATIONS\n\nCENTRAL PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nImposing of Entertainment Taxes by the Kandy Municipal Council\n\nThe following resolution passed by the Kandy Municipal Council under decision No. 8 (23) at the General Meeting held on 20.12.2018in terms of Sub - section (I) of Section 2 of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance (Chapter 267) has been approved by the Hon. Governor ofthe Central Province in terms of Sub - section (2) of that Section and is hereby published in terms of that Sub - Section.\n\nMAITHREE GUNARATNE,\n\nHon. Governor,Central Province.At Governor\u2019s Office,On this 22nd day of April, 2019.\n\nRESOLUTION\n\nIn accordance with Section 2 (1) of the Entertainment Tax ordinance and Entertainment Tax (Amended) Act, No. 37 of 1984, the KandyMunicipal Council hereby resolves to impose and levy an entertainment Tax equivalent to 25% of the face value of entry tickets for everymagic show, circus, horse show, musical show, exhibition match, carnival and any other event where a fee is charged and an entertainmenttax equivalent to 7.5% of the face value of entry tickets to films in cinemas hed in the area within the administrative limits of the KandyMunicipal Council.\n\n08 - 797\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
  },
