    "chunk_text": "IV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'08'06PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 06.08.20192 A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nPayment of fuel allowance of Rs. 2,500 for the Members of the Urban Council of Central Province.\n\n*The Chairman/Deputy Chairman shall receive this allowance it he\u2019s not receiving such at the moment. One person\n\nis not entiled for two allowances for one purpose.\n\n*This is not relevant to Municipal Councils.\n\n*Maximum limit for each member is Rs. 2,500/- if one does not own a motor cycle/Three wheeler or other motor\n\nvehicle, one may use any other vehicle and shall produce bills or documents. One may obtain relevant runningcharts.\n\n*One may produce details of running for council duties and monitoring development works.\n\n08 - 800"
