    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'08'07PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 07.08.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2135$44 \u2013 2019 wf.daia;= 07 jeks nodod \u2013 2019'08'072135/44 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 07, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAllotments of lands, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KU/IBB/2018/269 dated 02.08.2018 prepared by the Surveyor-Generalsituated in the Village called Siyambalawehera, in the No. 485Siyambalawehera Grama Niladari Division, in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Ibbagamuwa in Kurunegala District in NorthWestern Province and boundaries as follows.\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Kottagahamulawatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0064 HectareNorth: Kottagahamulawatta claimed by A. P. Somapala andPradeshiya Sabha Road; East: Lot No. 2; South: Lot No. 3 andMalgahamuladalupothe Pillewa claimed by A. Sirimawathi; West:Kottagahamulawatta claimed by A. P. Somapala.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 \u2013 Extent: 0.0330 HectareNorth: Pradeshiya Sabha Road; East: Kandegedara Grama NiladhariDivision; South: Pradeshiya Sabha Road and Malgahamuladalupothaclaimed by A. P. Indrakanthi and others; West: Lot Nos. 4, 3, 1 andKottagahamulawatta claimed by A. P. Somapala."
